OL,3,GNEWSASearch resumes for men missing in
OL,4,A'worst fishing tragedy for a
OL,5,Ageneration'
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe search has resumed for two men and
OL,8,Fa fishing vessel missing off the Isle
OL,9,Fof Lewis.
OL,11,FThe Kilda was reported overdue on 13
OL,12,FOctober and the body of 49-year old
OL,13,FDouglas Craigie was recovered the
OL,14,Ffollowing day. His two crewmates, Tam
OL,15,FMurray and Murdo Morrison, have still
OL,16,Fnot been found.
OL,18,FAfter setting up a fundraiser for the
OL,19,Ffamilies of all three men, the Western
OL,20,FIsles Fishing Association said the loss
OL,21,Fis ''one of the worst fishing tragedies
OL,22,Fin a generation in the Western Isles''.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
