OL,3,GNEWSASearch resumes for men missing in
OL,4,A'worst fishing tragedy for a
OL,5,Ageneration'
OL,6,
OL,7,FSearches were initially called off on
OL,8,F18 October with specialist officers
OL,9,Ffrom Police Scotland's Marine and Dive
OL,10,Funit now working in an area of interest
OL,11,Foff the coast.
